{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And all its fat, etc.</b> Until here the emurim of an asham had not been specified — therefore it was necessary to specify them here. But a hatat — its emurim had already been specified in the perashah of Vayikra." "<b>The tail.</b> Because an asham can only be brought from a ram or a lamb, and ram and lamb are subsumed under tail."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:23.146015611Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}